WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.959 --> 00:00:02.002
- WHOA.

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.754
- MAN, I FELT SORRY
FOR THAT DUDE,

00:00:03.754 --> 00:00:04.880
BUT, YOU KNOW,
WHAT YOU GONNA DO?

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.757
I HAD TO LAY
THAT [bleep] DOWN.

00:00:06.757 --> 00:00:08.050
[laughter]
YOU KNOW I DID, DOG.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:10.719
- WHAT?
THAT [bleep] LAY YOU DOWN.

00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:12.596
- HEY, BROTHER, I DON'T KNOW
WHAT FIGHT YOU WAS AT.

00:00:12.596 --> 00:00:14.181
THAT [bleep] GOT
A COUPLE LICKS IN, SURE.

00:00:14.181 --> 00:00:16.266
BUT PFFT, I WAS LIKE, BIP!

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:17.809
[laughter]

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:19.978
MAN, I PUT THE PUSSY
ON THE CHAIN WAX.

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:22.314
[both howling]

00:00:22.314 --> 00:00:25.317
PUT THE PUSSY ON THE--
both: THE CHAIN WAX.

00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:28.111
- I PUT THE PUSSY
ON THE CHAIN WAX.

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:30.280
all: I PUT THE PUSSY
ON THE CHAIN WAX.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:34.034
- PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX?
- HMM?

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:37.329
- IS THAT A THING?

00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:38.622
- WELL, YEAH. THAT--YEAH.

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:39.915
THAT'S A--THAT'S A THING.

00:00:39.915 --> 00:00:41.667
- YEAH.
- YEAH, THAT'S SOMETHING.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:44.002
- OKAY.

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:45.295
- YEAH, I PUT THE PUSSY
ON THE CHAIN WAX.

00:00:45.295 --> 00:00:47.047
- PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX!

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.716
- I SAID I PUT THE PUSSY
ON THE CHAIN WAX!

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.343
- HE PUT THE PUSSY
ON THE CHAIN WAX.

00:00:51.343 --> 00:00:53.720
- PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX.
- PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.222
- UH, PUSSY COMING IN.

00:00:55.222 --> 00:00:56.515
THIS IS THE CHAIN WAX.
- HOLD UP.

00:00:56.515 --> 00:00:58.433
[laughter]
HOLD UP.

00:00:58.433 --> 00:01:01.645
I JUST, UM, GOOGLED
"PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX."

00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:03.105
NO RESULTS.

00:01:03.105 --> 00:01:05.774
- MAN, UM,
WHY ARE YOU GOOGLING?

00:01:05.774 --> 00:01:07.442
- NO, I'M JUST SAYING.

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:10.612
"PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX,"
IT'S NOT AN EXPRESSION.

00:01:10.612 --> 00:01:12.030
- YE--YEAH IT IS.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.198
- YEAH, IT IS.
- YES, THANK YOU.

00:01:13.198 --> 00:01:14.533
- IT'S SOMETHING, LEO.
- YEAH.

00:01:14.533 --> 00:01:16.368
- WHAT IT--WHAT IT--
WHAT DOES IT MEAN THEN?

00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:18.120
- WHAT DOES IT MEAN?

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:19.830
I'LL TELL YOU WHAT IT MEANS.
- DO IT, DO IT.

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:25.377
- IT MEANS THAT...

00:01:25.377 --> 00:01:26.837
IS THAT YOU PUT THE...

00:01:26.837 --> 00:01:29.840
all: PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX!

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:31.383
[overlapping chatter]

00:01:31.383 --> 00:01:32.759
- NOPE, NOPE.

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:33.885
both: PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX!

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:35.387
- IT'S NOT--DON'T--

00:01:35.387 --> 00:01:36.555
- PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX!
- PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX.

00:01:36.555 --> 00:01:38.473
- ACTING LIKE Y'ALL KNOW
WHAT IT IS--

00:01:38.473 --> 00:01:40.100
OKAY, HAVE EITHER
OF THE TWO OF YOU--

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.853
HAVE YOU EVER SAID THE WORDS

00:01:42.853 --> 00:01:45.188
"PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX"
IN ANY CONTEXT?

00:01:45.188 --> 00:01:47.482
- PFFT, US?
- PFFT.

00:01:47.482 --> 00:01:49.109
HE--HE TALKING TO YOU.
- MAN--

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:50.485
- HE AIN'T TALKING TO ME.

00:01:50.485 --> 00:01:52.571
- [exhales]
- HEY, MAN.

00:01:52.571 --> 00:01:54.031
IT'S NOT OUR FAULT
THAT YOU AIN'T NEVER PUT THE...

00:01:54.031 --> 00:01:56.450
all: PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX!

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:57.617
[all cheering]
- PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX!

00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:00.996
- NO ONE CAN PUT THE PUSSY
ON THE CHAIN WAX

00:02:00.996 --> 00:02:03.999
'CAUSE PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX
AIN'T A THING!

00:02:03.999 --> 00:02:06.251
YOU TRYING TO START A THING,
AREN'T YOU?

00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:09.212
- WHA--ME--
[laughs]

00:02:09.212 --> 00:02:12.424
I MEAN, WHAT ARE YOU TALKING
ABOUT, TRYING TO START A THING?

00:02:12.424 --> 00:02:15.093
- A THING,
LIKE "OFF THE HOOK"

00:02:15.093 --> 00:02:16.428
OR "I'MA PUT YOU ON BLAST."

00:02:16.428 --> 00:02:18.221
YOU TRYING TO GET IT
IN THE ETHER,

00:02:18.221 --> 00:02:21.016
SO EVERYBODY OUT THERE SAYING
"PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX."

00:02:21.016 --> 00:02:22.392
- MAN, WHY ARE YOU
DOING THIS?

00:02:22.392 --> 00:02:24.227
WHY YOU LOOKING UP
[bleep] I'M SAYING AND--

00:02:24.227 --> 00:02:26.104
AND FACT-CHECKING MY ASS
AND [bleep]?

00:02:26.104 --> 00:02:29.524
- YOU KEEP SAYING SOME [bleep]
THAT DOESN'T EXIST,

00:02:29.524 --> 00:02:31.026
AND YOU GOT THING ONE
AND THING TWO

00:02:31.026 --> 00:02:33.195
CORROBORATING YOUR STORY
LIKE IT DOES,

00:02:33.195 --> 00:02:34.863
AND THEN--
WHY YOU LYING THEN?

00:02:34.863 --> 00:02:37.199
IT'S BULL[bleep]!

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:42.913
- BODIE...

00:02:45.874 --> 00:02:50.921
WHY DO YOU CARE SO MUCH

00:02:50.921 --> 00:02:56.385
WHETHER I MADE UP
"PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX" OR NOT?

00:03:00.097 --> 00:03:02.724
I LOST MY JOB.

00:03:04.726 --> 00:03:07.270
MY GIRL LEFT ME.

00:03:09.481 --> 00:03:13.819
AND ALL I W--
ALL I WANTED TO DO

00:03:13.819 --> 00:03:19.032
WAS HAVE A LITTLE BIT OF FUN
WITH MY FRIENDS TODAY.

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:20.450
SO WHY--WHY DO YOU HA--

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.911
WHY DO YOU HAVE TO BELITTLE ME
LIKE THAT?

00:03:22.911 --> 00:03:27.082
- [sighs]

00:03:27.082 --> 00:03:28.959
IT'S JUST THAT I--
- YEAH?

00:03:28.959 --> 00:03:31.294
- I'M JUST TRYING TO SAY--

00:03:31.294 --> 00:03:34.965
- WHAT YOU TRYING TO SAY,
[bleep]?

00:03:34.965 --> 00:03:37.551
- I'M TRYING TO SAY

00:03:37.551 --> 00:03:40.846
THAT I WANT
TO PUT THE PUSSY...

00:03:40.846 --> 00:03:44.266
all: ON THE CHAIN WAX!

00:03:44.266 --> 00:03:46.059
[laughter]

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:47.727
- HE DID IT, YO.
HE PUT THE...

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:50.063
all: PUSSY ON THE CHAIN WAX!
- YEAH!

